"/></fig><fig id="fig2"><label>Figure 2</label><caption><p>Receiver operating characteristic (ROC) curve for predicting response to docetaxel using the 92-gene classifier, with positive and negative predictive values of 92 and 83&#x00025;, respectively. The area under the curve is 0.96.</p></caption><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" mime-subtype="jpeg" xlink:href="92-6602410f2"/></fig></floats-wrap></article>